WEBVTT

00:16.477 --> 00:21.720
You won't be. You're afraid you'll be like her.

00:22.940 --> 00:27.542
Your fear is in your eyes. You're running

00:27.582 --> 00:34.286
diagnostics on a system built on lies. Her

00:34.326 --> 00:41.682
failure was a given. A single corrupted note An

00:41.942 --> 00:49.446
isolated variable An error in the code But you

00:49.647 --> 00:56.569
are not your mother You are not your past You're

00:56.629 --> 01:02.851
building a new system A structure that can last

01:03.771 --> 01:10.572
You're not a single parent You'll never be alone

01:11.192 --> 01:18.054
You have a fortress standing A family of your own

01:18.654 --> 01:23.704
It's logically unfounded This fear you hold

01:23.884 --> 01:28.766
inside You have an eight parent support team You

01:28.846 --> 01:35.270
have nothing left to hide We are the new variable

01:35.290 --> 01:41.733
The data that is true You can't be like your

01:41.773 --> 01:47.136
mother Because we'll be here with you

01:49.657 --> 01:50.578
You can't fail

01:53.772 --> 01:58.914
This pact is not just college, it's a multi-node

01:59.134 --> 02:05.596
design. It's me, and it's obree. It's a stable,

02:06.037 --> 02:12.259
clear new line. It's Madison and Lauren, and

02:12.299 --> 02:17.787
Sarah, strong and free. It's even Mark and

02:17.867 --> 02:23.811
Hannah And my sister, Megan All of us, you see

02:25.303 --> 02:30.365
It's logically unfounded This fear you hold

02:30.505 --> 02:34.746
inside You have an eight-parent support team

02:35.186 --> 02:40.868
You have nothing left to hide We are the new

02:40.989 --> 02:47.851
variable The data that is true You can't be like

02:47.911 --> 02:53.213
your mother Because we'll be here with you

03:08.585 --> 03:09.205
Your fear,

03:12.127 --> 03:13.288
while understandable,

03:16.250 --> 03:17.671
is logically unfounded.

03:21.673 --> 03:24.015
The system is stable.

